    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1 · Poll and fan out\nEvery two minutes, new outage tickets are fetched and **each one is triaged in its own execution** of *Outage ticket triage agent*, so the agent always works on exactly one ticket. Claiming happens there, so overlapping polls cannot process a ticket twice.",
