      "id": "402bca94-aeab-4327-af09-1e2f88601bd4"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Energy & Utilities · Outage ticket poller\n**Job:** find new outage tickets and hand each one to *Energy & Utilities · Outage ticket triage agent*, one execution per ticket.\n\n**Why separate:** one ticket per agent run keeps each triage independent: a failure on one ticket never affects another, and the agent can never mix two tickets' data.",
        "height": 194,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1000,
        -420
      ],
      "name": "Overview",
      "id": "15a7b80f-e83f-40c6-acf8-acad3807d5f0"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup\n1. Import this workflow and *Energy & Utilities · Outage ticket triage agent*.\n2. Credential: **Header Auth** for the ops gateway on *Fetch new outage tickets*.\n3. Edit **Config**: gateway URL and batch size. The URL is passed to each triage run.\n4. Activate this workflow only.",
        "height": 182,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 1
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
